#!args --verify-dirty
# screen readers (ui/desk.rs, a11y.rs): each window is a dialog named by its title (and its
# state), the active one selected; its title bar's buttons and its content hang inside it in the
# tree, also where a smaller window above it covers them (here the Rechner covers the Editor's
# Übernehmen); minimised windows are named in the taskbar
theme light
expect dialog:"Protokoll" selected
expect dialog:"Editor" exists
click button:"Baum"
expect text:"Baum: Editor(5) Rechner(12) Notizen(5) Protokoll*(4) | Übernehmen→Editor 5→Rechner Wichtig→Notizen" exists
# maximised: named so; the windows behind keep their content
click button:"Maximieren: Protokoll"
expect dialog:"Protokoll (maximiert)" selected
click button:"Baum"
expect text:"Baum: Editor(5) Rechner(12) Notizen(5) Protokoll (maximiert)*(5) | Übernehmen→Editor 5→Rechner Wichtig→Notizen" exists
# minimised: gone from the tree, the taskbar names it
click button:"Minimieren: Protokoll"
expect dialog:"Protokoll (maximiert)" missing
expect button:"Protokoll (minimiert)" exists
expect dialog:"Notizen" selected
click button:"Baum"
expect text:"Baum: Editor(5) Rechner(12) Notizen*(5) | Übernehmen→Editor 5→Rechner Wichtig→Notizen" exists
expect_nowarn
